<title>UK: LW Rentenbank sets 10 bln peseta structured bond.</title>
<headline>LW Rentenbank sets 10 bln peseta structured bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Caja de Madrid and UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LANDWIRTSCHAFTLICHE RENTENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    10 BLN PTA    COUPON   * 7.00	MATURITY    25.MAR.07</p>
<p> TYPE   FIXED/FRN     ISS PRICE  101.375   PAY DATE    25.MAR.97</p>
<p> NOTES    * FOR FIRST FOUR YEARS, THEN 12.45 PCT MINUS 12MLIBOR</p>
<p>		MINIMUM THREE PERCENT.</p>
<p> FEES	 1.875     LISTING    AIAF	DENOMS (K)  100</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
